    <http://example.org/node/chunk98> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our company's company context, I can confirm that our company's have experience in managing projects with a hybrid delivery model combining agile iterations with a phase-gate structure, which is suited to public and health procurement. our company's past references include working with a regional hospital group on a pilot assistant for medical documentation, integrated with a regional hospital group electronic patient record, which demonstrates our company's ability to work in a healthcare setting. our company's have a dedicated team available, including a project director, solution architect, engineers, data scientist, and security compliance lead, as well as additional resources for change management and training. our company's available capacity allows our company's to take on concurrent public health engagements, and our company's have confirmed availability for The project. our company's consortium partners, such as OuraneCloud and Ligeo Santé, can provide expertise in French sovereign cloud provision and health-IT integration, which can help address the requirements for data sovereignty, security, and interoperability. our company's also have a joint research program with a French public AI research laboratory on retrieval-augmented generation and explainability, which can inform our company's approach to developing an intelligent assistance tool." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk99> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of governance, our company's have a proven track record of working with clients through a joint steering committee and operational committee, with a single point of contact and a documented escalation path. our company's can provide a RACI matrix to ensure clear roles and responsibilities throughout The project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

